vkq3ng (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of vkq3ng - Vulkan Quake 3 Next Generation engine
  * Vulkan renderer with ray-tracing support
  * Wayland native backend with X11 fallback
  * SDL2 audio backend (replaces OSS)
  * FSR-style render scaling
  * Vendor-neutral GPU selection
  * Multi-GPU compute offload stub
  * AI denoiser / TSR / predictors stub
  * io_uring file I/O (opt-in)

